### Manual Verification
- You can now see that the red squiggly lines in [src/lib/supabase/server.ts](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/lib/supabase/server.ts) have disappeared (you might need to restart the TypeScript server in your IDE if they persist, but the build proves they are gone).
